1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,374
Maple Lane: a quiet suburban street in Spring Hill, at least until someone got

2
00:00:04,374 --> 00:00:04,844
murdered.

3
00:00:05,064 --> 00:00:06,813
Here's how the location plays.

4
00:00:07,633 --> 00:00:11,806
Make four Item decks of three cards instead of the usual setup, one for each

5
00:00:11,806 --> 00:00:14,332
quadrant of houses, with the top card face up.

6
00:00:14,552 --> 00:00:17,453
Then add both Convince Action cards to the Action Tableau.

7
00:00:18,267 --> 00:00:22,186
There are twelve Houses, three in each quadrant, and every House counts as a Search

8
00:00:22,186 --> 00:00:22,469
space.

9
00:00:22,689 --> 00:00:26,853
A successful search draws from that quadrant's deck, then the House gets an X token

10
00:00:26,853 --> 00:00:28,257
and can't be searched again.

11
00:00:29,067 --> 00:00:32,779
The residents are suspicious, so you can't walk into a House with Victims in it.

12
00:00:32,999 --> 00:00:36,077
Use a Convince card from the next Street space to get in.

13
00:00:36,077 --> 00:00:40,613
Leaving is normal movement, empty Houses are open, and panicking Victims and Enemies

14
00:00:40,613 --> 00:00:41,639
go where they like.

15
00:00:42,467 --> 00:00:46,695
A few tips. Each House can only be searched once, so plan routes across all four

16
00:00:46,695 --> 00:00:47,224
quadrants.

17
00:00:47,444 --> 00:00:51,817
The Bible adds two dice to Convince, and with three successes you can take the top

18
00:00:51,817 --> 00:00:53,631
Item without searching. Good luck.

